      "text": "Many apps are free to download but place core features behind in-app purchases. Before installing, look for IAP markers, subscription plans, and trial language. If the store page is vague, assume the useful version may cost more than the download price.",
      "textZh": "很多应用可免费下载，但核心功能依赖内购。安装前查看内购标记、订阅方案和试用文案。如果商店页表述模糊，应默认真正好用的版本可能比下载价更贵。"
