      "headingZh": "检查试用转正风险",
      "text": "A free trial is useful only if you know the end date, renewal price, and cancellation path. Set a reminder one day before renewal. Do not rely on deleting the app. Cancellation lives in Apple ID subscription settings, not on the home screen.",
      "textZh": "免费试用只有在你清楚结束日期、续费价格和取消路径时才安全。续费前一天设置提醒。不要依赖删除应用来停止扣费；取消入口在 Apple ID 订阅设置，不在主屏幕。"
