      "text": "Some paid apps still require subscriptions for cloud sync, export, advanced filters, or multi-device access. Compare the base purchase with the recurring plan. A slightly higher one-time price can be better value than a low entry price with expensive renewals.",
      "textZh": "有些付费应用仍需要订阅才能云同步、导出、使用高级滤镜或多设备访问。把本体购买和周期订阅一起比较。略高的一次性价格，有时比低门槛但高续费的方案更划算。"
