      "text": "Before install or Start Trial, open the full IAP list and write one job per SKU: unlock export, remove ads, add seats, or sell consumable coins. If two SKUs buy the same job, keep the lower annualized option. If a SKU has no job you can name, treat it as a future trap even when the base app is free. Store the map with a screenshot of the offer sheet. Households that skip the map argue later about mystery Pro lines in Purchase History. Public lookup tools can speed scanning, but your confirm sheet remains the contract.",
      "textZh": "安装或开始试用前，打开完整内购列表，为每个 SKU 写一句话用途：解锁导出、去广告、加席位，或卖消耗币。若两个 SKU 买同一用途，留年化更低者。若 SKU 说不出用途，即使本体免费也当未来陷阱。地图与报价页截图放一起。跳过映射的家庭稍后会为购买记录里神秘 Pro 行争吵。公开查询工具能加速扫描，但确认页仍是合约。"
