      "heading": "Start with functional necessity",
      "headingZh": "先从功能必要性判断",
      "text": "Ask whether a permission supports the core feature. Navigation needs location. Scanning needs camera. A wallpaper app usually does not need precise location, and a calculator usually does not need contacts. If the permission is optional for the main task, grant it later or never.",
      "textZh": "先问这个权限是否服务核心功能。导航需要定位，扫码需要相机；壁纸应用通常不需要精确位置，计算器通常不需要通讯录。如果权限对主任务不是必须，可以稍后授权，甚至不授权。"
