      "headingZh": "如果 iOS 提供有限访问，优先选择",
      "text": "iOS often allows “selected photos,” “while using,” or “ask next time.” These options reduce long-term exposure. After installation, reopen Settings and remove permissions that the app requested during onboarding but does not need for daily use.",
      "textZh": "iOS 常提供“选中的照片”“使用期间允许”或“下次询问”。这些选项能降低长期暴露。安装后重新打开设置，撤销应用在引导阶段索取、但日常并不需要的权限。"
