  "description": "How to track trial end dates, cancel cleanly, avoid surprise renewals, and decide whether a paid plan is still worth keeping.",
  "descriptionZh": "如何跟踪试用结束日期、干净取消、避免意外续费，并判断付费方案是否仍值得保留。",
