      "text": "For every region claim from social media, log source, date, app identity, three-column sheet status, and decision. Most claims die at incomplete sheets. Logs prevent re-litigating the same rumor every month. Keep logs with other purchase research notes, not in chat graves.",
      "textZh": "对每条来自社媒的地区说法，记录来源、日期、应用身份、三列表状态与决策。多数说法死于不完整的表。日志防止每月重审同一谣言。日志与其他购买研究笔记放一起，不要埋在聊天里。"
