      "text": "Success is fewer surprise installs, zero unexplained family Apple charges, and kids using the waiting list without secret workarounds. Track those metrics monthly. If secret installs rise, tighten free-download gates before adding more lectures. Metrics keep policy honest.",
      "textZh": "成功是意外安装更少、家庭 Apple 扣费零无法解释、孩子使用等待列表而无秘密绕过。每月跟踪这些指标。若秘密安装上升，先收紧免费下载闸门再加说教。指标让政策诚实。"
