      "heading": "Commercial terms capture template",
      "headingZh": "商业条款抓取模板",
      "text": "Before Start Trial write: trial length, first charge date, post-trial price, period, annualized cost, cancel path, Apple ID, device. Screenshot the confirm sheet. Missing cells mean do not start. This template is the defense playbook’s spine and should live in Purchases with the app name.",
      "textZh": "开始试用前写：试用时长、首次扣费日、试用后价格、周期、年化成本、取消路径、Apple ID、设备。截图确认页。缺格就不要开始。此模板是防御手册脊椎，应按应用名放在 Purchases。"
