      "heading": "Label versus first-launch prompt worksheet",
      "headingZh": "标签与首启提示工作表",
      "text": "Two columns: label claims, live prompts. Screenshot both. Mismatch is a stop until explained. Auditors believe behavior over marketing. Store the pair in Purchases before install decisions on shared devices.",
      "textZh": "两列：标签宣称、实机提示。两边截图。不一致则解释前停止。审计员信行为胜过营销。共用设备安装决策前把这一对存 Purchases。"
