      "heading": "Children education claims and data categories",
      "headingZh": "儿童教育宣称与数据类别",
      "text": "Education marketing does not excuse broad data-used-to-track rows. Prefer known education vendors and school-required lists. On child accounts, combine label reading with Screen Time and free-download gates. Write school name for exceptions with end dates.",
