      "heading": "Day-zero allow-once default for rare tasks",
      "headingZh": "罕见任务第零天默认允许一次",
      "text": "For camera, mic, location, and photos on rare tasks, prefer Allow Once over permanent Allow. Permanent grants need a weekly recurring job. After Once, if you did not re-need the permission in forty-eight hours, you probably did not need permanent access. Teach teens Allow Once as the default so onboarding storms do not become lifetime grants.",
      "textZh": "对罕见任务的相机、麦克风、定位与照片，优先允许一次而非永久。永久授予需要每周重复用途。允许一次后若四十八小时内不再需要，多半不需要永久访问。教青少年默认允许一次，避免引导风暴变成终身授权。"
